<title>UK: LIFFE Oct white sugar deliveries total 281 lots.</title>
<headline>LIFFE Oct white sugar deliveries total 281 lots.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A total of 281 lots of white sugar, equivalent to 14,050 tonnes, was delivered against the London October No.5 contract after it expired on Friday, the London International Financial Futures Exchange (LIFFE) said.</p>
<p>Details are as follows:</p>
<p>    DELIVERERS     LOTS     RECEIVERS	 PORT</p>
<p>    Refco		15	 ICS	   Gdynia</p>
<p>    Refco	     255	 Man	   Gdynia</p>
<p>    Refco		 1	 Man	   Gdansk</p>
<p>    Refco		10	 Man	   Gdynia</p>
<p>-- Jeremy Smith, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
